          "fill": "#1a1a1a",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 1392,
          "content": "CENTER PANE: Dual-mode mapping editor (Blockly visual blocks / CodeMirror text). Blocks are auto-generated from loaded OPT. Orange dashed slots show mapped values; gray dashed slots await mapping. The [+ Add optional RM structure] button allows inserting feeder_audit, participation, etc.",
